  "ruleText": "Gcd 202.02 Construction of Rules. Parts Gcd 203-213 and Gcd 215 shall be construed to secure the just, accurate and efficient resolution of all disputes.\n\nSource. #7635-A, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10339, eff 5-17-13",
